  "description": "Compile-time Roslyn incremental generator for Betta plugins. Emits a Betta.Generated.BettaPluginBootstrap that Betta's runtime picks up as a fast-path descriptor manifest, skipping the reflection scan on load. Also emits BETTA001/BETTA011 diagnostics for unsupported parameter types and overloaded component methods, and keeps betta.lock, a checked-in list of the plugin's component GUIDs: BETTA012 warns when a rename would break saved .gh files. Optional — Betta's runtime reflection fallback works fine without it.",
  "developmentDependency": true,
